        <Param val="True" valType="bool" updates="None" name="syncScreenRefresh"/>
        <Param val="You will now see every name presented in the experiment. In the first part of the survey, you will be asked to respond how easily a person with the same name in your prersonal comes to mind. In the second part, please rate the names in the following way:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How easily does the name come to mind? Rate the name 1-5. &amp;#10;1 = &quot;Not at all easy&quot; &amp;#10;5 = &quot;extremely well&quot;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How many names come to mind? Rate the name from 1-5&amp;#10;1 = 0 &amp;#10;2 = 1-2&amp;#10;3 = 3-4 &amp;#10;4 = 4-5 &amp;#10;5 = 6+" valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
